# Destructive Git operations are prohibited

Do not use:

- `git reset --hard`;
- `git restore`;
- `git checkout -- <file>`;
- checkout-based file restoration;
- history rewriting;
- forced branch replacement;
- deleting uncommitted work;
- replacing a file from HEAD merely because it differs from the baseline.

Destructive operations require explicit user authorization.
<!-- MEW-GIT-SAFETY_END -->
